\section{\ifchinese 简介\else Introduction\fi}

\ifchinese
\pkg{times-math} 使 Times New Roman 用于数学排版成为可能。
它采用 Times New Roman 的字母、数字和适用的数学符号，
由 TeX Gyre Termes Math、附带的 Times Math Integrals 和 XITS Math
补足数学排版能力与其余字形。
\else
\pkg{times-math} makes it possible to use Times New Roman for mathematics.
It uses Times New Roman letters, digits and suitable symbols, with
TeX Gyre Termes Math, the bundled Times Math Integrals font and XITS Math
supplying mathematical layout and the remaining glyphs.
\fi

\ifchinese
Times New Roman 不含 OpenType MATH 表。
排版参数、可增长的定界符、大算符和重音由数学字体提供。
本包基于 \pkg{unicode-math}，使用 LuaLaTeX 或 XeLaTeX 编译。
\else
Times New Roman has no OpenType MATH table. Math fonts provide layout
parameters, growing delimiters, large operators and accents.
The package uses \pkg{unicode-math} and requires LuaLaTeX or XeLaTeX.
\fi

\section{\ifchinese 安装与使用\else Installation and usage\fi}
\label{sec-install}

\ifchinese
从源码提取包文件：
\else
Extract the package file from the sources:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
xetex times-math.ins
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
将生成的 \file{times-math.sty} 与附带的 \file{times-math-integrals.otf}
一起放在文档目录，即可使用。安装到用户 TEXMF 树可执行：
\else
Place the extracted \file{times-math.sty} and the bundled
\file{times-math-integrals.otf} beside your document. To install both
in your user TEXMF tree, run:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
l3build install
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
手动安装时，两类文件分别放入以下位置：
\else
For a manual TEXMF installation, use these locations:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
tex/latex/times-math/times-math.sty
fonts/opentype/public/times-math/times-math-integrals.otf
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
Times New Roman 需自行安装；TeX Gyre Termes Math 和 XITS Math 随
\TeX{} Live 提供。补充 OTF 已附带，无需为日常排版重新生成。
\else
Install Times New Roman separately. TeX Gyre Termes Math and XITS Math
are available in \TeX{} Live. The supplementary OTF is included and
does not need rebuilding for normal use.
\fi

\begin{docblock}
\subsection{\ifchinese 最小示例\else Minimal example\fi}
\label{sec-usage}

\begin{verbatim}
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{times-math}
\begin{document}
$E=mc^2$, $\alpha+\beta=\gamma$, $\mathbb{R}$.
\[
  \sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
\]
\end{document}
\end{verbatim}
\end{docblock}

\begin{docblock}
\ifchinese\indent\fi
\ifchinese
\pkg{amsmath} 和 \pkg{unicode-math} 会自动加载。
本包只设置数学字体，不修改正文、无衬线或等宽文字字体。
正文也要用 Times New Roman 时，另行设置：
\else
\pkg{amsmath} and \pkg{unicode-math} are loaded automatically.
The package sets math fonts only; it does not change the document's
roman, sans-serif or monospaced text fonts. To use Times New Roman for
the body text as well, add:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\setmainfont{Times New Roman}
\end{verbatim}
\end{docblock}

\ifchinese
系统没有 Times New Roman 时，本包会警告并跳过文字字体层。
也可显式选用 TeX Gyre Termes，详见第~\ref{sec-text-font}~节。
\else
If Times New Roman is unavailable, the package warns and omits the
text-font layer. You can explicitly select TeX Gyre Termes;
see section~\ref{sec-text-font}.
\fi

