\else
Matching ignores ordinary spaces and case, then restores
the canonical font name for font lookup and configuration. For example,
\opt{TeXGyreTermes} and \opt{tex gyre termes} are equivalent.
Unknown or empty values stop compilation with an error.
\fi

\ifchinese
\opt{text-font=none} 显式关闭文字字体层，只使用数学字体，且不产生
缺字体警告。默认字体缺失时也会跳过该层，但会发出警告；
不会自动启用 TeX Gyre Termes 文字字体层。
\else
\opt{text-font=none} explicitly disables the text-font layer and uses
only the math fonts, without a missing-font warning. An unavailable
default font also causes the layer to be skipped, but with a warning;
the TeX Gyre Termes text layer is not enabled automatically.
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\usepackage[text-font=none]{times-math}
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
该选项选择的是内置配置，并不接受任意文字字体。
\else
This option selects a built-in configuration; it does not accept an
arbitrary text font.
\fi

\subsection{\opt{math-font}}

\ifchinese
默认值为 \opt{XITS Math}，提供数学参数和最后一级字形回退。
可填写字体名或字体文件名；替换字体须含有 OpenType MATH 表，
并覆盖文档所需的其余符号。
TeX Gyre Termes Math 与补充积分号字体仍会加载，Times New Roman 的优先级不变。
基底字体的参数会影响分式、上下标和重音的位置。
\else
The default, \opt{XITS Math}, supplies the math parameters and final
glyph fallback. A font name or filename can be used. A replacement
needs an OpenType MATH table and the
remaining symbols required by the document. TeX Gyre Termes Math and
the integral supplement are still loaded, and Times New Roman keeps
its priority. The base font's parameters affect fractions, scripts and
accent placement.
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\usepackage[math-font=STIXTwoMath-Regular.otf]{times-math}
\end{verbatim}

\subsection{\opt{math-style}, \opt{bold-style}}

\ifchinese
这两个选项交给 \pkg{unicode-math}，控制普通字母与粗体字母的样式。
未指定时沿用 \pkg{unicode-math} 的默认设置。
例如，选择 ISO 样式：
\else
These options are passed to \pkg{unicode-math} to select the styles
of ordinary and bold letters. When omitted, its defaults are used.
For example, to select the ISO styles:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\usepackage[math-style=ISO,bold-style=ISO]{times-math}
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
取值及字母样式规则见 \file{unicode-math.pdf}。
如果文档已经加载了 \pkg{unicode-math}，可直接使用其设置命令：
\else
See \file{unicode-math.pdf} for the available values and alphabet
rules. If the document has already loaded \pkg{unicode-math}, use
its setup command directly:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\unimathsetup{math-style=ISO,bold-style=ISO}
\end{verbatim}

\section{\ifchinese 宏包兼容性\else Package compatibility\fi}

\ifchinese
\pkg{amsmath} 已由本包加载。
\pkg{mathtools}、\pkg{amsthm} 和 \pkg{siunitx} 可以共同使用；
下面的加载顺序可用于定理、扩展公式命令和单位排版：
\else
\pkg{amsmath} is already loaded by this package.
\pkg{mathtools}, \pkg{amsthm} and \pkg{siunitx} can be used alongside
it. The following loading order supports theorem environments,
extended equation commands and units:
\fi

\begin{verbatim}
\usepackage{mathtools,amsthm,siunitx}
\usepackage{times-math}
\end{verbatim}

\ifchinese
不要再加载替换数学字体的宏包，例如 \pkg{newtxmath}、\pkg{txfonts}
或 \pkg{mathptmx}，否则会改变本包设置的字体。
旧式符号与字母字体包 \pkg{amssymb}、\pkg{amsfonts}、\pkg{latexsym}、
\pkg{mathrsfs}、\pkg{eucal}，以及 \pkg{bm} 也不应重复加载。
这些包可能重定义命令、覆盖字形，某些加载顺序还会直接报错。
本包在文档开始时检查后面这六个包并发出警告。
\else
Do not also load packages that replace the math fonts, such as
\pkg{newtxmath}, \pkg{txfonts} or \pkg{mathptmx}; they change the
font setup established here. The legacy symbol and alphabet packages
\pkg{amssymb}, \pkg{amsfonts}, \pkg{latexsym}, \pkg{mathrsfs},
\pkg{eucal}, and the \pkg{bm} package should also be omitted.
They may redefine commands, override glyphs or cause errors, depending
on loading order. \pkg{times-math} checks for these last six packages at the
start of the document and issues a warning.
\fi

