\section{\ifchinese 字体差异与缺字\else Font differences and missing glyphs\fi}

\ifchinese
Times New Roman 的不同版本在字形设计和覆盖范围上可能有差别。
由数学字体提供的定界符、大算符和特殊字母也保留各自字体的设计。
\else
Versions of Times New Roman can differ in glyph design and coverage.
Delimiters, large operators and special alphabets retain the designs
of the math fonts that supply them.
\fi

\ifchinese
查找命令名、Unicode 码位和字形对照可看 \file{times-math-glyphs.pdf}。
其中 N 列是本包采用 \opt{literal} 数学样式时的输出，
其余列按码位显示原始字体的字形。
\else
The \file{times-math-glyphs.pdf} reference lists command names, Unicode
codepoints and font comparisons. Its N column shows package output
with \opt{literal} math styles; the other columns show raw font glyphs
at the listed codepoints.
\fi

\ifchinese
数学字母样式并非对所有字符都有对应变体。
例如 Unicode 没有完整的双线斜体字母表，\cmd{symbbit} 不能为任意
拉丁字母生成双线斜体。带变体的希腊字母和样式嵌套也应检查实际输出。
缺字时，日志会给出码位和查找失败的字体；报告问题时应附上该信息及
能复现的最小文档。
\else
Not every character has a counterpart in every math alphabet.
For example, Unicode does not encode a complete double-struck italic
alphabet, so \cmd{symbbit} cannot supply one for arbitrary Latin
letters. Check the output of variant Greek letters and nested style
commands as well. Missing-glyph messages in the log identify the
codepoint and the font used; include that information and a minimal
document when reporting a problem.
\fi

\ifchinese
在本包之后重新调用不带 \opt{range} 的 \cmd{setmathfont}，
会替换整个数学字体设置。只调整某些字符时，应明确给出字符区间，
并检查它是否覆盖了本包已有的设置。
\else
A subsequent \cmd{setmathfont} call without \opt{range} replaces the
whole math setup. For a local character change, specify the intended
range and check which package assignments it overrides.
\fi

